'''Candy Corn''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Reforge Stone]] that applies the {{Reforge|Candied}} [[Reforge]] to [[Armor]], granting {{Stat|hp}}, {{Stat|def}}, and increasing the chance for mobs to drop candy during the [[Spooky Festival]].

__TOC__

== Obtaining ==
'''Candy Corn''' has a {{Green|3.13%}} overall chance to drop from a [[Spooky Festival#Trick Or Treat Chests|Trick or Treat Chest]] during the [[Spooky Festival]].

While [[Foxy]]'s [[Foxy#Mayor Perks|A Time for Giving]] perk is active, [[Party Chest]]s replace Trick or Treat Chests. Each Party Chest rolls its loot {{green|2-4 times}}, with each roll having a {{Green|3.105%}} chance to contain '''Candy Corn'''.

== Usage ==
===Reforging===
'''Candy Corn''' can be applied to [[Armor]] using an [[Anvil]] or [[The Hex]] to apply the {{Reforge|Candied}} reforge. This has no {{skill|mining}} requirement and can be done with any armor, regardless of the piece.

Additionally, it grants the '''{{Blue|Candied Bonus}}''', which makes mobs {{Green|1%}} more likely to drop candy during the [[Spooky Festival]].

