== Tips ==
* Applying the {{Reforge|Candied}} reforge to all four equipped armor pieces makes mobs a total of {{Green|4%}} more likely to drop candy during the [[Spooky Festival]].

== Trivia ==
* '''Candy Corn''' is based on [[w:Candy corn|candy corn]], a real-world type of candy.

